.venv/
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
secrets.env
*.jsonl
spike/out/
evals/out/
# A pytest run that passes a relative --basetemp drops its whole temp tree in the repo.
# 50 such files sat untracked here on 2026-10-23, one `git add -A` from being published.
pytest-of-mm/
# Design mockups stay local: they carry internal names (systemd timer units, hostnames,
# the account tier). command-center.html is the exception, it is the approved phase 8
# target and is tracked in scrubbed form. The `/*` form is required, not `docs/design/`:
# git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so ignoring the
# directory itself would make the negation below dead.
docs/design/*
!docs/design/command-center.html
